ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 DrivesList / RegenEfficiency precedents — 5-file surface)
  TripPlannerPageModel.kt        framework-free: registration ids + SOC slider bounds + the four
                                 SpeedFactors (web speedOptions); TripPlannerFormState (web useState
                                 block) + buildPlanRequest (web handlePlan req body: charge_limit_soc
                                 90, preferences{speed_factor, include_weather, prefer_superchargers});
                                 parseTripPlan (decodes POST /trip-planner/plan → route/legs/charge_
                                 stops/weather/soc_curve, EMPTY guard = web `{route && …}`); statTiles
                                 + formatDuration (the six StatCard value expressions); the pure
                                 mappers onto the child snapshots (mapToMapSnapshot/mapToSocPoints/
                                 mapToSocChargeStops/mapToRouteBreakdown); TripPlannerDisplayPrefs
                                 (web useUnits/useFormatting) — convertDistanceFromSI + formatEnergy +
                                 currency at the boundary; recordTripPlannerPageOpened (view.opened).
  TripPlannerPageSource.kt       seam over DrivingRepository.planTrip (web usePlanTrip, POST
                                 /trip-planner/plan) + DrivingRepository.geocodeSearch (web
                                 useGeocodeSearch) + VehiclesStore.vehicles (web useVehicles) +
                                 VehiclesStore.vehicleState (web useVehicleState, battery chip) +
                                 SettingsStore.settings (web useUnits) + SelectedVehicleStore (web
                                 useSelectedVehicle) + ApiHttpClient (Send-to-Car navigation_request).
  TripPlannerPageViewModel.kt    BaseFeedViewModel; form: StateFlow<TripPlannerFormState>; planState:
                                 StateFlow<UiState<TripPlanResult>> — mutation-driven, rests Empty
                                 then Loading→Content (success) / Loading→Error (failure), prior plan
                                 survives a failure (web mutation keeps `plan`); vehicleOptions /
                                 displayPrefs / vehicleBattery / canPlan StateFlows; planTrip /
                                 sendToCar / selectVehicle / setters / recordViewOpened. No HTTP in
                                 the view (errorKindOf/httpStatusOf classify the mutation failure).
  TripPlannerPage.kt             stateless TripPlannerPageContent + the eight Material 3 panels + the
                                 estimate disclaimer, route map, feasibility banner, SOC chart, and
                                 leg list; three local lucide glyphs (Send/DollarSign/Thermometer)
                                 authored as 24×24 stroked ImageVectors (no material-icons-extended).
  TripPlannerPageHost.kt         registers TripPlannerRoute for the `tripPlanner` destination
                                 (Destinations.kt L77, /trip-planner); wired in
                                 TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate() (NavHost registration).

REUSED CHILD SURFACES (already-ported A3 feature-views / shared-surfaces; composed by this page)
  TripPlannerMap   (featureviews.tripplannermap)  — route polyline + origin/destination/charge markers
  SOCRouteChart    (featureviews.socroutechart)   — "Battery Along Route" Vico area chart + stop rail
  TripLegList      (featureviews.tripleglist)     — "Route Breakdown" leg + charge-stop list
